sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant W as OutboxRelay
    participant R as Redis

    Note over W: @Scheduled(fixedDelay 500ms), no ShedLock (Spec04 §4.1)
    loop while the last batch was full
        W->>PG: BEGIN
        W->>PG: SELECT ... WHERE processed_at IS NULL AND failed_at IS NULL<br/>AND next_attempt_at <= now()<br/>ORDER BY created_at, id LIMIT 100 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        PG-->>W: batch
        loop each event
            W->>W: dealershipId + union(dates, oldDates, newDates)
            alt invalid payload
                W->>PG: failed_at = now(), last_error (no retry)
            else
                W->>R: INCR avail:ver:dealer:date + EXPIRE 2d
                alt Redis error, attempts + 1 <= 3
                    W->>PG: attempts + 1, next_attempt_at = now() + 2s
                else Redis error, 4th failure
                    W->>PG: attempts + 1, failed_at = now(), last_error
                    Note over W: ERROR log (English) for operators,<br/>booking unchanged
                else ok
                    W->>PG: processed_at = now()
                end
            end
        end
        W->>PG: COMMIT
    end
